\ulnone\cf2 Michael W. Wiseman was arrested on Friday in Florida after being accused of making threats against Donald Trump and his running mate JD Vance, as well as the two men's families. The Jupiter, Fla. police said that he was arrested on charges of written threats to kill, namely social media posts.}
