\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Benjamin Carpenter, 34, was found guilty in October 2023 of attempting to provide material support to the foreign terrorist organization ISIS. Following his incarceration, he will be on supervised release for 20 years.}
