\ulnone\cf2 Rep. Zoe Lofgren and Sen. Martin Heinrich, along with eight other congressional Democrats, have joined the lengthy list of lawmakers asking President Joe Biden to quit the 2024 presidential race. These calls come as rumors of his potential making that exit as soon as this weekend, as well increasing pressure from Democrats, swirl around the campaign.}
