\ulnone\cf2 In an interview with wPolityce.pl, Witold Waszczykowski, the former Polish minister of foreign affairs and a former MEP for Law and Justice Party (PiS), has expressed his strong disapproval of Ursula von der Leyen's reelection as the head of the European Commission.}
